Here is the full analysis, verified against `registerReaderFactory`/`registerWriterFactory` calls, class declarations, and CMakeLists.txt in `/home/knataraj/velox`.

---

## Summary Counts

| Metric | Count |
|--------|-------|
| **Core Velox format readers** (dwio registered factories) | **4** |
| **Core Velox format writers** (dwio registered factories) | **3** |
| **Core Velox connector DataSources** (readers) | **6** (3 file-format, 3 synthetic/generated) |
| **Core Velox connector DataSinks** (writers) | **2** |
| **cuDF readers** | **1** (CudfHiveDataSource) |
